        "Differentiate $\\frac{dy}{dx} \\implies \\frac{d^2y}{dx^2} = \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4x+1}}$.",
        "Multiply: $\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4x+1}} \\times \\sqrt{4x+1} = 2$, which is constant."
